window.EN_MAP = {"参考分为社区经验估算值，XJTLU 官方从不公布专业分流分数线；实际录取按当年容量与报名情况浮动，请务必以学校 12 月底发布的正式通知为准。":"The reference scores are estimates based on community experience. XJTLU officially never publishes cutoff scores for program streams. Actual admissions vary based on the year's capacity and application numbers. Please refer to the official notice released by the university in late December for the most accurate information.","人工智能与先进技术学院":"School of Artificial Intelligence and Advanced Technology","设计学院":"Design","人文社科学院":"College of Humanities and Social Sciences","西浦国际商学院":"Westchester Business School","数学物理学院":"School of Mathematics and Physics","生命与自然科学学院":"School of Life and Natural Sciences","影视与创意科技学院":"School of Film, Television and Creative Technologies","太仓创业家学院":"Taicang Entrepreneurship Academy","微积分":"Calculs","MTH013 / MTH026 等":"MTH013 / MTH026, etc.","作业":"Operations","期中":"Interim letter","期末":"End of period","线性代数":"Linear Algebra","MTH007 / MTH028 等":"MTH007 / MTH028, etc.","EAP 学术英语":"EAP Academic English","全年 20":"Full Year 20","大一上选修":"Elective in the first semester of freshman year","10 学分":"10 credits","计算机科学与技术":"Computer Science and Technology","微积分 + 线性代数":"Calculus + Linear Algebra","物理 + 多元微积分":"Physics + Multivariable Calculus","用代码把想法变成能跑的系统":"Turn ideas into working systems with code","系统学习编程、数据结构与算法、计算机组成、操作系统与软件工程，从底层原理到工程方法打通，训练独立设计和实现复杂软件系统的能力。":"Systematically study programming, data structures and algorithms, computer architecture, operating systems, and software engineering, covering everything from foundational principles to engineering methodologies, and develop the ability to independently design and implement complex software systems.","软件 / 算法工程师":"Software / Algorithm Engineer","数据与后端开发":"Data and Backend Development","读研深造":"Postgraduate Studies","产品与创业":"Products and Entrepreneurship","常见去向：UCL、帝国理工、爱丁堡、KCL、曼大等英国院校的 CS / AI / Data Science 硕士，也有新加坡国立、港大。多数项目要求本科均分 65+（2:1），G5 方向通常要 70+ 并看重项目经历。":"Common destinations: CS/AI/Data Science master's programs at UK universities such as UCL, Imperial College London, University of Edinburgh, King's College London, and the University of Manchester, as well as the National University of Singapore and the University of Hong Kong. Most programs require an undergraduate GPA of 65+ (2:1), while G5 programs typically require 70+ and place importance on project experience.","电气工程及其自动化":"Electrical Engineering","从电路到电网，让能量可控":"From circuits to the grid, making energy controllable","学习电路、电磁场、电力电子、电机与自动控制，掌握电气系统与智能电网的分析、设计与调试。":"Study circuits, electromagnetic fields, power electronics, electrical machines, and automatic control, and master the analysis, design, and commissioning of electrical systems and smart grids.","电力系统 / 电网":"Power System / Power Grid","新能源与储能":"New Energy and Energy Storage","自动化与嵌入式":"Automation and Embedded Systems","读研":"Postgraduate study","常见去向：帝国理工、曼大、爱丁堡的 Electrical Power Systems / Control 硕士，港大与新加坡国立也常见。":"Common destinations: Master's programs in Electrical Power Systems/Control at Imperial College London, the University of Manchester, and the University of Edinburgh. The University of Hong Kong and the National University of Singapore are also common choices.","电子科学与技术":"Electronic Science and Technology","芯片、电路与信号的世界":"The World of Chips, Circuits, and Signals","围绕电子器件、集成电路、信号与通信电子展开，从半导体物理一路学到电路设计，理解硬件是怎么被造出来的。":"Focusing on electronic devices, integrated circuits, signals, and communication electronics, you will learn everything from semiconductor physics to circuit design and understand how hardware is made.","芯片设计与验证":"Chip Design and Verification","硬件 / 嵌入式":"Hardware / Embedded","射频与通信设备":"Radio Frequency and Communication Equipment","常见去向：帝国理工、UCL、南安普顿的微电子 / 集成电路硕士，港科大与新加坡国立也受欢迎。":"Common destinations: Master's programs in Microelectronics/Integrated Circuits at Imperial College London, UCL, and the University of Southampton. HKUST and the National University of Singapore are also popular choices.","数字媒体技术":"Digital Media Technology","既懂技术，也懂内容":"Understanding both technology and content","结合计算机技术与数字内容创作，学习图形图像、交互设计、游戏与虚拟现实开发，做出既好看又好用的数字产品。":"Combining computer technology with digital content creation, students learn about graphics and images, interaction design, and game and virtual reality development to create digital products that are both visually appealing and user-friendly.","游戏 / 引擎开发":"Game / Engine Development","交互与前端开发":"Interaction and Front-End Development","影视后期与特效":"Film and Television Post-Production and Special Effects","常见去向：UCL、爱丁堡、KCL 的 HCI / 游戏 / 数字媒体方向；也有去皇艺、伦艺读交互设计的。":"Common destinations: HCI/Gaming/Digital Media programs at UCL, University of Edinburgh, and King's College London; some also go to the Royal College of Art and London College of Communication to study Interaction Design.","信息与计算科学":"Information and Computing Science","多元微积分":"Multivariable Calculus","数学打底，计算为器":"Foundation in mathematics, calculation as a tool","以数学为基础、计算机为工具，学习数值计算、优化、数据分析与建模，解决工程和金融里的实际问题。":"Using mathematics as the foundation and computers as the tool, students learn numerical computation, optimization, data analysis, and modeling to solve practical problems in engineering and finance.","数据分析 / 算法":"Data Analysis / Algorithms","量化与金融科技":"Quantitative Analysis and Financial Technology","软件研发":"Software R&D","常见去向：LSE、UCL、爱丁堡的 Data Science / Applied Mathematics；偏金融数学的会申 IC、KCL。":"Common destinations: Data Science/Applied Mathematics at LSE, UCL, and the University of Edinburgh; those with a preference for financial mathematics will apply to IC and KCL.","机械电子工程":"Mechatronics and Robotic Systems","让机器自己动起来":"Let the machine move on its own.","融合机械、电子与控制，学习机器人机构、传感器、嵌入式与自动控制，能独立搭建并调试机电系统。":"Integrating mechanics, electronics, and control, students learn about robotic mechanisms, sensors, embedded systems, and automatic control, enabling them to independently build and debug electromechanical systems.","机器人 / 自动化":"Robotics / Automation","智能制造":"Intelligent Manufacturing","汽车电子":"Car Electronics","常见去向：帝国理工、曼大、谢菲的 Robotics / Mechatronics 硕士；德国亚琛、慕工大也很受欢迎。":"Common destinations: Master's programs in Robotics/Mechatronics at Imperial College London, the University of Manchester, and the University of Sheffield. RWTH Aachen University and the Technical University of Munich in Germany are also popular choices.","通信工程":"Telecommunications Engineering","把信息送得更远、更稳":"Transmit information farther and more stably","学习信号与系统、通信原理、无线与光通信、网络协议，理解并设计现代通信系统。":"Study signals and systems, communication principles, wireless and optical communication, and network protocols to understand and design modern communication systems.","通信设备与运营商":"Communication Equipment and Operators","网络与协议开发":"Network and Protocol Development","芯片与射频":"Chips and Radio Frequency","常见去向：帝国理工、UCL、南安普顿的 Communications / Wireless 硕士。":"Common destinations: Master's in Communications/Wireless at Imperial College London, UCL, and the University of Southampton.","人工智能（智能系统）":"Artificial Intelligence (Intelligent Systems Pathway)","让机器学会感知、推理和决策":"Enable machines to learn to perceive, reason, and make decisions","学习机器学习、深度学习、计算机视觉、自然语言处理与强化学习，以及支撑它们的数学与工程实现，目标是能独立做出可用的智能系统。":"Study machine learning, deep learning, computer vision, natural language processing, and reinforcement learning, as well as the mathematical and engineering implementations that underpin them, with the goal of being able to independently create usable intelligent systems.","算法工程师":"Algorithm Engineer","机器学习 / 数据科学":"Machine Learning / Data Science","计算机视觉或 NLP":"Computer Vision or NLP","常见去向：帝国理工、UCL、爱丁堡、曼大的 AI / Machine Learning 硕士，多要求一等或 2:1。":"Common destinations: AI/Machine Learning master's programs at Imperial College London, UCL, the University of Edinburgh, and the University of Manchester. Most require a first-class or 2:1 degree.","建筑学":"Architecture","微积分 + 建筑/设计类选修（ARC001 / DES002 / DES003 / DES004 任一门）":"Calculus + Architecture/Design Elective (any one of ARC001 / DES002 / DES003 / DES004)","多元微积分 + DES002 / DES004":"Multivariable Calculus + DES002 / DES004","在图纸与模型之间造空间":"Creating space between drawings and models","学习建筑设计、建筑历史与理论、结构与材料、制图与建模。设计课（studio）是核心，反复做方案、被评图、再改，训练真实的方案能力。":"Study architectural design, architectural history and theory, structures and materials, drafting and modeling. The design studio is at the core of the program. Students repeatedly develop designs, have them critiqued, and then revise them, thereby honing their practical design skills.","建筑设计院":"Architectural Design Institute","城市与景观设计":"Urban and Landscape Design","室内与展陈":"Interior and Exhibition","常见去向：UCL Bartlett、AA、爱丁堡、谢菲的建筑设计硕士。申请必须交作品集，一般要求 2:1 及以上。":"Common destinations: Master of Architecture programs at UCL Bartlett, AA, University of Edinburgh, and the University of Sheffield. Applicants must submit a portfolio, and a 2:1 or higher is generally required.","工业设计":"Industrial Design","好用、好看、还造得出来":"Functional, attractive, and manufacturable","从用户需求出发，学习产品造型、人机工程、材料工艺与设计表达，兼顾美学与可制造性。":"Based on user needs, students learn about product design, ergonomics, materials and processes, and design expression, taking into account both aesthetics and manufacturability.","产品 / 工业设计":"Product / Industrial Design","用户体验设计":"User Experience Design","设计咨询":"Design Consulting","常见去向：皇艺、伦艺、米兰理工、代尔夫特的产品设计硕士，需作品集。":"Common destinations: Master's programs in Product Design at the Royal College of Art, University of the Arts London, Politecnico di Milano, and Delft University of Technology. A portfolio is required.","土木工程":"Civil Engineering","让结构站得住，让城市转得动":"Keep the structure standing and the city moving","学习结构力学、材料、岩土与工程施工，掌握建筑与基础设施的分析、设计与建造管理。":"Study structural mechanics, materials, geotechnical engineering, and construction practices to master the analysis, design, and construction management of buildings and infrastructure.","设计院 / 施工企业":"Design Institute / Construction Company","工程咨询与造价":"Engineering Consulting and Cost Estimation","市政与轨道交通":"Municipal and Rail Transit","常见去向：帝国理工、UCL、剑桥（MPhil）、曼大的 Civil / Structural 硕士。":"Common destinations: Imperial College London, UCL, Cambridge (MPhil), and the University of Manchester for a Master's in Civil/Structural Engineering.","城乡规划":"Urban Planning and Design","无先修要求":"No prerequisites","无":"&None","看懂城市，再改变城市":"Understand the city, then change the city","学习城市空间、土地利用、交通与规划政策，用规划和设计工具分析并改善真实的城市问题。":"Study urban spaces, land use, transportation, and planning policies, and use planning and design tools to analyze and improve real-world urban issues.","规划院 / 政府部门":"Planning Institute / Government Department","地产与城市更新":"Real Estate and Urban Renewal","咨询":"Counseling","常见去向：UCL、剑桥、谢菲的 Urban Planning / Design 硕士。":"Common destinations: Master's in Urban Planning/Design at UCL, Cambridge, and Sheffield.","传播学":"Media and Communication Studies","会讲故事，也懂传播规律":"Able to tell stories and understand the principles of communication","学习新闻传播理论、媒介研究、数字内容生产与公关策略，能独立完成从策划到发布的全流程。":"Study journalism and communication theory, media studies, digital content production, and public relations strategies. Capable of independently completing the entire process from planning to publication.","新媒体运营":"New Media Operation","品牌公关":"Brand PR","内容制作":"Content Production","常见去向：LSE、KCL、华威、威敏的 Media & Communication 硕士。":"Common destinations: Master's in Media & Communication at LSE, KCL, Warwick, and Westminster.","英语（金融商务英语）":"English and Business","语言能力 + 商业嗅觉":"Language skills + business acumen","同时学习英语语言文学与商科基础，能在跨文化商务环境里沟通、写作并做基本的商业分析。":"Students will study both English language and literature and the fundamentals of business, enabling them to communicate, write, and perform basic business analyses in cross-cultural business environments.","外贸 / 跨境电商":"Foreign Trade / Cross-Border E-commerce","国际商务":"International Business with a Language","公关与市场":"Public Relations and Marketing","常见去向：华威、曼大、KCL 的 Business / International Management 硕士。":"Common destinations: Master's in Business/International Management at Warwick, University of Manchester, and King's College London.","翻译":"Translation and Interpreting","在两种语言之间精确搬运意义":"Accurately convey meaning between two languages","训练笔译、口译与本地化能力，学习翻译理论与 CAT 工具，目标是达到专业级的双语转换水平。":"Train translation, interpreting, and localization skills, learn translation theory and CAT tools, with the goal of achieving professional-level bilingual conversion.","笔译 / 口译":"Translation Interpretation","本地化与字幕":"Localization and Subtitles","国际组织":"International Organizations","常见去向：巴斯、纽卡、利兹的口译 / 翻译硕士，通常要笔试和面试。":"Common destinations: Master's programs in Interpreting/Translation at Bath, Newcastle, and Leeds typically require a written test and an interview.","国际事务与国际关系":"International Relations","看懂世界为什么这样运转":"Understand why the world works the way it does","学习国际政治理论、外交与全球治理，训练政策分析与论证写作的能力。":"Study international political theory, diplomacy, and global governance, and develop skills in policy analysis and argumentative writing.","外交与外事":"Diplomacy and Foreign Affairs","国际组织 / NGO":"International Organizations / NGOs","政策研究":"Policy Research","常见去向：LSE、SOAS、爱丁堡、KCL 的 IR / Public Policy 硕士。":"Common destinations: Master's in IR/Public Policy at LSE, SOAS, Edinburgh, KCL.","英语（应用语言学）":"Applied Linguistics","把语言拆开看，也教别人用":"Break down the language and teach others how to use it.","系统学习语言学理论、二语习得与英语教学法，具备语言分析与教学实践能力。":"Systematically studied linguistic theory, second language acquisition, and English teaching methodology, and possess skills in language analysis and teaching practice.","英语教学":"English Teaching","教材与出版":"Teaching Materials and Publications","语言测评":"Language Assessment","常见去向：UCL IOE、爱丁堡、华威的 Applied Linguistics / TESOL 硕士。":"Common destinations: UCL IOE, University of Edinburgh, and University of Warwick for Master's degrees in Applied Linguistics/TESOL.","英语（传媒英语）":"English and Communication Studies","语言 + 媒介，两条腿走路":"Language + Medium, Walking on Two Legs","结合英语语言能力与传播学训练，学习跨文化沟通、媒体写作与话语分析。":"Combining English language proficiency with communication training, students learn cross-cultural communication, media writing, and discourse analysis.","国际传播":"International Communications","翻译与本地化":"Translation and Localization","公关":"pr","常见去向：LSE、KCL、利兹的 Communication / Media 硕士。":"Common destinations: Master's in Communication/Media at LSE, KCL, and the University of Leeds.","英语（全球语境下的英语研究）":"English Studies in Global Context","在全球化语境里用英语思考":"Thinking in English in the Context of Globalization","以英语文学与文化研究为主，训练细读、批判性写作与跨文化理解能力。":"Focusing on English literature and cultural studies, this program develops skills in close reading, critical writing, and cross-cultural understanding.","出版与编辑":"Publishing and Editing","教育":"Education","文化机构":"cultural-institution","常见去向：爱丁堡、KCL、华威的 English Literature / Cultural Studies 硕士。":"Common destinations: Master's in English Literature/Cultural Studies at the University of Edinburgh, King's College London, and the University of Warwick.","汉学与中国学":"China Studies","用世界的眼光看中国":"Viewing China from a Global Perspective","从历史、社会、政治与经济多学科视角理解当代中国，训练研究与跨文化表达。":"Understand contemporary China from a multidisciplinary perspective encompassing history, society, politics, and economics, and develop skills in research and cross-cultural communication.","公共事务 / 政策研究":"Public Affairs / Policy Studies","媒体与文化机构":"Media and Cultural Institutions","常见去向：LSE、SOAS、爱丁堡的中国研究 / 国际关系硕士。":"Common destinations: LSE, SOAS, Master's in Chinese Studies/International Relations at the University of Edinburgh.","经济学":"Economics","用模型解释选择与市场":"Explaining Choice and Markets with Models","学习微观与宏观经济学、计量与数理方法，能用数据和模型分析现实中的经济问题。":"Study micro- and macroeconomics, econometrics, and mathematical methods to analyze real-world economic issues using data and models.","经济研究 / 政策":"Economic Research / Policy","金融分析":"Financial Analysis","常见去向：LSE、UCL、华威、爱丁堡的 Economics 硕士，一般要求 2:1，且很看数学类课程成绩。":"Common destinations: Master's in Economics at LSE, UCL, Warwick, and Edinburgh. Generally, a 2:1 is required, and grades in mathematics-related courses are highly considered.","经济与金融":"Economics and Finance","经济学的脑子，金融的手":"The mind of economics, the hand of finance","结合经济学理论与金融市场实务，学习资产定价、公司金融与计量分析。":"Combining economic theory with financial market practice, students learn about asset pricing, corporate finance, and quantitative analysis.","投行 / 券商":"Investment Bank / Brokerage Firm","基金与资管":"Funds and Asset Management","风险管理":"Risk management","常见去向：LSE、帝国理工、UCL 的 Finance / Economics and Finance 硕士，属于申请最卷的方向之一。":"Common destinations: Master's degrees in Finance/Economics and Finance from LSE, Imperial College London, and UCL are among the most competitive programs to apply for.","会计学":"Accounting","数字背后的商业语言":"The Business Language Behind the Numbers","学习财务会计、管理会计、审计与税法，建立能读懂并编制财务报表的硬技能。":"Study financial accounting, management accounting, auditing, and tax law to develop the hard skills needed to read and prepare financial statements.","四大 / 会计师事务所":"Big Four / Accounting Firms","企业财务":"business finance","投行与券商":"Investment Banking and Brokerage","常见去向：LSE、帝国理工、华威、曼大的 Accounting & Finance 硕士，通常要求 2:1 并看数理背景。":"Common destinations: LSE, Imperial College London, University of Warwick, and the University of Manchester's Master's in Accounting & Finance programs typically require a 2:1 and consider the applicant's mathematical background.","信息管理与信息系统":"Information Management and Information Systems","在业务与技术之间搭桥":"Bridging the gap between business and technology","学习信息系统设计、数据库、数据分析与项目管理，把业务需求翻译成可以落地的系统方案。":"Study information systems design, databases, data analysis, and project management to translate business requirements into actionable system solutions.","IT 咨询":"IT Consulting","产品经理":"Product Manager","数据分析":"Data analysis","常见去向：UCL、LSE、华威的 Information Systems / Business Analytics 硕士。":"Common destinations: Master's in Information Systems/Business Analytics at UCL, LSE, and Warwick.","需修满第二外语两个阶段":"Two levels of a second foreign language must be completed","一门专业，加一门外语":"One major, plus one foreign language","在国际商务核心课程之外，系统学习第二外语并达到两个阶段，为跨国环境工作做准备。":"In addition to the core curriculum in International Business, students systematically study a second foreign language and complete two levels, preparing them for work in a multinational environment.","跨国企业":"Multinationals","国际贸易":"International Trade","海外市场":"overseas market","常见去向：华威、曼大、ESCP 等 International Business 硕士。":"Common destinations: Master's in International Business at Warwick, University of Manchester, ESCP, etc.","工商管理":"Business Administration","学会把一群人组织起来做事":"Learn how to organize a group of people to get things done","覆盖战略、组织、运营、市场与财务，训练综合管理视角和团队协作能力。":"Covers strategy, organization, operations, marketing, and finance, and develops a comprehensive management perspective and team collaboration skills.","管理培训生":"Management Trainee","运营 / 项目":"Operations / Projects","常见去向：华威、曼大、KCL 的 Management 硕士，部分项目需要 GMAT。":"Common destinations: Management master's programs at Warwick, University of Manchester, and King's College London. Some programs require the GMAT.","市场营销":"Digital and Intelligent Marketing","理解人，然后说服人":"Understand people, then persuade them","学习消费者行为、品牌管理、数字营销与市场研究，能策划并评估一次完整的营销活动。":"Study consumer behavior, brand management, digital marketing, and market research to plan and evaluate a complete marketing campaign.","品牌 / 市场":"Brand / Market","数字营销":"Digital-marketing","消费者研究":"Consumer Research","常见去向：LSE、华威、曼大的 Marketing 硕士。":"Common destinations: LSE, Warwick, and the University of Manchester for a Master's in Marketing.","人力资源管理":"Human Resource Management and People Analytics","用数据管人，而不只是凭感觉":"Manage people with data, not just feelings","学习组织行为、招聘培训、薪酬绩效，并引入数据分析方法支持人力决策。":"Study organizational behavior, recruitment and training, compensation and performance, and introduce data analysis methods to support HR decision-making.","组织发展":"Organizational Development:","人力咨询":"Human Resources Consulting","常见去向：LSE、华威、曼大的 HRM / Organisational Behaviour 硕士。":"Common destinations: LSE, Warwick, and the University of Manchester for Master's degrees in HRM/Organizational Behavior.","金融数学":"Financial Mathematics","微积分（MTH029 / MTH023）+ 线性代数（MTH017）":"Calculus (MTH029/MTH023) + Linear Algebra (MTH017)","数学、金融与编程的交叉点":"The Intersection of Mathematics, Finance, and Programming","用随机分析、数值方法与编程解决衍生品定价、风险度量等金融问题，数学要求是全校最高的方向之一。":"This program uses stochastic analysis, numerical methods, and programming to solve financial problems such as derivative pricing and risk measurement. The mathematical requirements are among the highest in the entire university.","量化交易":"Quantitative trading","金融科技":"Fintechs","常见去向：帝国理工、LSE、UCL 的 Financial Mathematics / Mathematical Finance 硕士。":"Common destinations: Master's in Financial Mathematics/Mathematical Finance at Imperial College London, LSE, and UCL.","精算学":"Actuarial Science","给风险定价":"Pricing risk","学习概率统计、精算模型、寿险与非寿险数学，课程内容对接精算师资格考试。":"Study probability and statistics, actuarial models, and the mathematics of life and non-life insurance. The course content is aligned with the actuarial qualification exams.","精算师":"contracts Actuaries","保险与再保险":"Insurance and Reinsurance","常见去向：LSE、贝叶斯商学院、赫瑞瓦特的 Actuarial Science 硕士，部分可豁免考试科目。":"Common destinations: LSE, Bayes Business School, and Heriot-Watt's Master of Actuarial Science. Some of these programs offer exemptions from certain exam subjects.","应用数学":"Applied Mathematics","把抽象数学用到真实世界":"Applying abstract mathematics to the real world","学习数学分析、代数、微分方程与数值方法，训练用数学建模解决工程与科学问题的能力。":"Study mathematical analysis, algebra, differential equations, and numerical methods, and develop the ability to use mathematical modeling to solve engineering and scientific problems.","数据科学":"Data Science","量化研究":"Quantitative Research","算法工程":"Algorithm Engineering","常见去向：剑桥 Part III、帝国理工、UCL、爱丁堡的 Applied Mathematics / Data Science 硕士。":"Common destinations: Cambridge Part III, Imperial College London, UCL, and MSc in Applied Mathematics/Data Science at the University of Edinburgh.","生物信息学":"Bioinformatics","用代码读懂生命":"Understanding Life Through Code","结合生物学与计算科学，学习基因组学、序列分析与统计建模，处理海量生物数据。":"Combine biology and computational science, study genomics, sequence analysis, and statistical modeling, and process vast amounts of biological data.","生物信息分析":"Bioinformatics Analysis","医药研发":"Pharmaceutical R&D","科研院所":"Research Institutions","常见去向：UCL、爱丁堡、帝国理工的 Bioinformatics / Computational Biology 硕士。":"Common destinations: Master's in Bioinformatics/Computational Biology at UCL, the University of Edinburgh, and Imperial College London.","生物医学科学":"Biomedical Sciences","面向疾病的生物学":"Disease-oriented biology","聚焦人体生理、病理、免疫与药理学，为医学与生物医药研究打基础。":"Focuses on human physiology, pathology, immunology, and pharmacology, laying the foundation for medical and biomedical research.","临床研究 / CRA":"Clinical Research / CRA","继续攻读医学":"Continue studying medicine","常见去向：UCL、帝国理工、KCL 的 Biomedical Sciences 硕士；也有学生转申医学方向。":"Common destinations: Master's in Biomedical Sciences at UCL, Imperial College London, and King's College London; some students also switch to apply for programs in the field of medicine.","生物科学":"Biological Sciences","从细胞到生态系统":"From Cells to Ecosystems","系统学习分子生物学、遗传学、生理与生态，配合大量实验训练科研基本功。":"Systematic study of molecular biology, genetics, physiology, and ecology, combined with extensive experimental training in fundamental research skills.","科研 / 高校":"Research / Higher Education","生物医药":"Biomedicine","检测与临床":"Testing and Clinical Practice","常见去向：UCL、帝国理工、爱丁堡的 Biomedical / Molecular Biology 硕士。":"Common destinations: Master's programs in Biomedical/Molecular Biology at UCL, Imperial College London, and the University of Edinburgh.","环境科学":"Environmental Science","理解地球，然后保护它":"Understand the Earth, then protect it","学习生态、大气与水环境、环境监测与政策，具备环境问题的调查与评估能力。":"Study ecology, atmospheric and water environments, environmental monitoring and policy, and develop the ability to investigate and assess environmental issues.","环境咨询":"Environmental Consulting","ESG / 可持续发展":"ESG / Sustainability","常见去向：帝国理工、UCL、爱丁堡的 Environmental Science / Management 硕士。":"Common destinations: Master's in Environmental Science/Management at Imperial College London, UCL, and the University of Edinburgh.","应用化学":"Applied Chemistry","从分子层面改造材料":"Transforming materials at the molecular level","学习有机、无机、分析与物理化学，配合大量实验技能训练，能独立设计并完成合成与分析。":"Study organic, inorganic, analytical, and physical chemistry, combined with extensive training in experimental skills, enabling independent design and completion of synthesis and analysis.","化工 / 材料研发":"Chemical / Materials R&D","医药与检测":"Medicine and Testing","质量控制":"Quality control","常见去向：帝国理工、UCL、曼大的 Chemistry / Materials 硕士。":"Common destinations: Master's programs in Chemistry/Materials at Imperial College London, UCL, and the University of Manchester.","材料科学与工程":"Materials Science and Engineering","新材料的发现者":"Discoverer of new materials","学习材料的结构、性能与制备工艺，理解金属、陶瓷、高分子与复合材料的设计逻辑。":"Study the structure, properties, and preparation processes of materials, and understand the design logic of metals, ceramics, polymers, and composites.","材料研发":"Materials R&D","新能源 / 半导体":"New Energy / Semiconductors","质量与工艺":"Quality and Craftsmanship","常见去向：帝国理工、曼大、谢菲的 Materials Science 硕士。":"Common destinations: Master's in Materials Science at Imperial College London, the University of Manchester, and the University of Sheffield.","数字媒体艺术":"Digital Media Arts","技术就是画笔":"Technology is the paintbrush","学习数字影像、交互装置、动效与虚拟制作，用技术手段完成艺术表达。":"Learn about digital imaging, interactive installations, motion graphics, and virtual production to achieve artistic expression through technological means.","交互艺术":"Interactive Art","动效 / 视觉设计":"Motion Graphics / Visual Design","游戏美术":"Game Art","常见去向：皇艺、伦艺、金史密斯的 Digital Media / Computational Arts 硕士。":"Common destinations: Master's programs in Digital Media/Computational Arts at the Royal College of Art, University of the Arts London, and Goldsmiths, University of London.","影视摄影与制作":"Filmmaking","从剧本到成片":"From script to finished film","学习编剧、导演、摄影、剪辑与制片全流程，在实践中完成自己的短片作品。":"Learn the entire process of screenwriting, directing, cinematography, editing, and production, and complete your own short film through hands-on practice.","导演 / 摄影":"Director / Cinematographer","剪辑 / 后期":"Editing / Post-production","影视制片":"Film Production","自由创作":"Free Creation","常见去向：NFTS、伦艺、哥大、NYU 的电影制作硕士，全部需要作品集。":"Common destinations: NFTS, UAL, Columbia University, and NYU for a Master's in Filmmaking. All require a portfolio.","广播电视学":"TV Production","为屏幕生产内容":"Producing content for screens","学习电视节目策划、演播室制作、直播与流媒体内容运营。":"Learn about TV program planning, studio production, live broadcasting, and streaming content operations.","节目编导":"Program Director","直播 / 短视频":"Live Streaming / Short Videos","内容运营":"Content Operations","常见去向：威敏、伦艺、金史密斯的 TV / Media Production 硕士。":"Common destinations: Master's programs in TV/Media Production at Westminster, UAL, and Goldsmiths.","药学":"Pharmaceutical Sciences","从分子到药品":"From Molecules to Medicines","学习药物化学、药剂学、药理学与药物分析，理解药物从设计、试验到上市的完整路径。":"Study medicinal chemistry, pharmaceutics, pharmacology, and pharmaceutical analysis to understand the complete path of a drug from design and testing to market launch.","药物研发":"Entwicklung von Medikamenten","药企注册 / QA":"Pharmaceutical Company Registration / QA","临床药学":"Clinical Pharmacy","常见去向：UCL、帝国理工、诺丁汉的药学 / 药物研发硕士。":"Common destinations: Master's in Pharmacy/Drug Development at UCL, Imperial College London, and the University of Nottingham.","生物制药":"Biopharmaceuticals","用生物体系造药":"Drug manufacturing using biological systems","聚焦生物技术制药，学习基因工程、细胞培养、纯化工艺与质量管理。":"Focus on biopharmaceutical manufacturing, learning about genetic engineering, cell culture, purification processes, and quality management.","生物药工艺":"Biopharmaceutical Process","研发 / QC":"R&D / QC","常见去向：UCL、爱丁堡、曼大的 Biopharmaceuticals / Biotechnology 硕士。":"Common destinations: Master's programs in Biopharmaceuticals/Biotechnology at UCL, the University of Edinburgh, and the University of Manchester.","应用统计学":"Biomedical Statistics","用统计证明药物有效":"Demonstrating drug efficacy through statistics","学习统计推断、临床试验设计与生物信息分析，为医学研究提供数据支撑。":"Study statistical inference, clinical trial design, and bioinformatics analysis to provide data support for medical research.","生物统计师":"Biostatistician","临床数据管理":"Clinical Data Management","医药数据分析":"Pharmaceutical Data Analysis","常见去向：UCL、伦敦卫生与热带医学院、爱丁堡的 Medical Statistics / Biostatistics 硕士。":"Common destinations: UCL, London School of Hygiene & Tropical Medicine, MSc in Medical Statistics/Biostatistics at the University of Edinburgh.","人工智能（产业 AI）":"Artificial Intelligence (Advanced Industrial AI)","苏州园区与太仓都开设":"Both Suzhou Industrial Park and Taicang have opened","聚焦产业场景中的计算机视觉、工业机器人与智能决策，课程与西浦太仓的产业伙伴深度绑定，大量真实项目。":"The curriculum focuses on computer vision, industrial robots, and intelligent decision-making in industrial settings. It is closely linked to XJTLU Taicang's industry partners and includes a large number of real-world projects.","工业 AI 工程":"Industrial AI Engineering","视觉算法":"Visual Algorithm","常见去向：帝国理工、UCL、爱丁堡的 AI / Robotics 硕士。":"Common destinations: Master's programs in AI/Robotics at Imperial College London, UCL, and the University of Edinburgh.","数据科学与大数据技术":"Data Science and Big Data Technology","从数据到决策":"From Data to Decision-Making","学习数据采集、存储、建模与可视化，结合产业项目解决真实的数据问题。":"Learn data collection, storage, modeling, and visualization, and solve real-world data problems in combination with industry projects.","数据分析 / 挖掘":"Data Analysis / Mining","大数据开发":"Big Data Development","产业数字化":"Industry Digitalization","常见去向：UCL、爱丁堡、曼大的 Data Science 硕士。":"Common destinations: Master's in Data Science at UCL, the University of Edinburgh, and the University of Manchester.","微电子科学与工程":"Microelectronic Science and Engineering","从晶圆到芯片":"From wafers to chips","学习半导体器件、集成电路设计与制造工艺，对接芯片产业的实际需求。":"Study semiconductor devices, integrated circuit design and manufacturing processes, and meet the actual needs of the chip industry.","芯片设计 / 制造":"Chip Design / Manufacturing","封装测试":"Packaging and Testing","半导体设备":"Semiconductor equipment","常见去向：帝国理工、UCL、南安普顿的 Microelectronics 硕士。":"Common destinations: Master's in Microelectronics at Imperial College London, UCL, and the University of Southampton.","机器人工程":"Intelligent Robotics Engineering","造会干活的机器人":"Build a robot that can do work","学习机器人运动学、感知、控制与系统集成，与产业伙伴共同开发机器人应用。":"Study robotics kinematics, perception, control, and system integration, and collaborate with industry partners to develop robotic applications.","机器人研发":"Robotics R&D","自动化集成":"Automation Integrations","常见去向：帝国理工、曼大、谢菲的 Robotics 硕士。":"Common destinations: Master's programs in Robotics at Imperial College London, the University of Manchester, and the University of Sheffield.","智能制造工程":"Intelligent Manufacturing Engineering","让产线自己优化":"Let the production line optimize itself","学习数字化制造、工业互联网与生产系统优化，在真实产线中做改进项目。":"Study digital manufacturing, the Industrial Internet, and production system optimization, and implement improvement projects on real production lines.","工艺 / 产线优化":"Process / Production Line Optimization","工业软件":"industrial software","常见去向：曼大、谢菲、帝国理工的 Advanced Manufacturing 硕士。":"Common destinations: Master's in Advanced Manufacturing at the University of Manchester, the University of Sheffield, and Imperial College London.","物联网工程":"Internet of Things Engineering","让万物联网":"Enabling the Internet of Everything","学习传感、嵌入式、无线通信与云平台，能端到端搭建一套物联网系统。":"Learn about sensing, embedded systems, wireless communication, and cloud platforms to build an end-to-end IoT system.","嵌入式开发":"Embedded Development","IoT 方案":"IoT Solutions","智能硬件":"Intelligent Hardware","常见去向：UCL、南安普顿、曼大的 IoT / Embedded Systems 硕士。":"Common destinations: UCL, Southampton, and the University of Manchester for a Master's in IoT/Embedded Systems.","供应链管理":"Intelligent Supply Chain with Contemporary Entrepreneurialism","让货流得更聪明":"Make freight flow smarter","学习供应链设计、运营优化与数字化技术，用数据提升从采购到交付的效率。":"Learn about supply chain design, operational optimization, and digital technologies to improve efficiency from procurement to delivery using data.","物流与采购":"Logistics and Procurement","运营分析":"Operations Analysis","常见去向：华威、曼大、克兰菲尔德的 Supply Chain 硕士。":"Common destinations: Master's in Supply Chain at Warwick, University of Manchester, and Cranfield.","艺术与科技":"Arts, Technology and Entertainment","艺术与产业在这里相遇":"Art and industry meet here","结合数字艺术与创业实践，学习沉浸式内容、交互体验与文化产业运营。":"Combining digital art with entrepreneurial practice, students learn about immersive content, interactive experiences, and cultural industry operations.","数字内容创作":"Digital Content Creation","文化科技":"Cultural Technology","策展 / 运营":"Curation / Operations","常见去向：皇艺、伦艺、金史密斯的 Computational Arts 硕士。":"Common destinations: Master's programs in Computational Arts at the Royal College of Art, University of the Arts London, and Goldsmiths, University of London.","心理学":"Psychology","微积分（MTH013）":"Calculus (MTH013)","多元微积分（MTH008）":"Multivariable Calculus (MTH008)","理解人为什么会这样想":"Understand why people think this way","学习认知、发展、社会与脑神经科学，做实验、设计问卷、用统计解释人的行为。":"Study cognition, development, social and brain neuroscience, conduct experiments, design questionnaires, and use statistics to explain human behavior.","用户研究":"User research","人力资源":"Human Resources","心理咨询":"Counselling","教育科研":"Educational Research","常见去向：UCL、KCL、爱丁堡、曼彻斯特的心理学或组织行为学硕士，多数要求 2:1。":"Common destinations: Master's degrees in Psychology or Organizational Behavior at UCL, KCL, Edinburgh, and Manchester, most of which require a 2:1.","应用物理学":"Applied Physics","把物理定律算成技术":"Considering physical laws as technology","在经典物理之上学量子、统计与计算物理，用数学建模解释真实世界，再落到器件与材料。":"Building on classical physics, I studied quantum, statistical, and computational physics, using mathematical modeling to explain the real world, and then applying it to devices and materials.","半导体研发":"Semiconductor R&D","光学工程":"Optical Engineering","继续读博":"Continue doctoral studies","常见去向：帝国理工、UCL、爱丁堡、代尔夫特的物理或材料方向硕士，一般要求 2:1 且看重数学课。":"Common destinations: Master's programs in physics or materials science at Imperial College London, UCL, the University of Edinburgh, and Delft University of Technology. Generally, a 2:1 degree is required, and emphasis is placed on mathematics courses.","这个专业教你让计算机按你的想法干活。先打基础：写程序（从 Python 到 C++）、学数据结构与算法（数据怎么存、怎么找最快）、搞懂计算机内部怎么运转（组成原理、操作系统），再学网络、数据库和软件工程。后两年开始选方向，可以偏人工智能、偏系统、偏安全。大量时间在电脑前写代码和调试，一个 bug 可能盯三个小时。数学不轻松，离散数学、概率统计都要学。":"This major teaches you how to make computers work according to your ideas. First, you build a foundation: writing programs (from Python to C++), learning data structures and algorithms (how to store data and how to find it the fastest), and understanding how computers work internally (composition principles, operating systems). Then, you move on to networking, databases, and software engineering. In the last two years, you start choosing your specialization, which can be in artificial intelligence, systems, or security. You'll spend a lot of time in front of the computer writing code and debugging. You might spend three hours trying to fix a single bug. Mathematics is not easy. You have to study discrete mathematics, probability, and statistics.","适合坐得住、愿意反复调试、对「为什么这样写更快」真的好奇的人。不喜欢长时间对着屏幕的话会比较痛苦。":"Suitable for people who can sit still, are willing to debug repeatedly, and are genuinely curious about \"why writing this way is faster.\" It can be quite agonizing if you don't like staring at a screen for long periods of time.","电气工程管的是电怎么产生、怎么送出去、怎么控制。核心课有电路分析、电磁场、模拟与数字电子、电机学、电力电子、自动控制，配实验课和课程设计。你会焊电路板、用示波器测波形、用仿真软件搭一个电网模型。毕业后去电网、新能源（风电、光伏、储能）、电动车、硬件公司。物理和数学都要扎实，实验报告写不完是常态。":"Electrical engineering deals with how electricity is generated, transmitted, and controlled. Core courses include Circuit Analysis, Electromagnetic Fields, Analog and Digital Electronics, Electrical Machinery, Power Electronics, and Automatic Control, complemented by laboratory sessions and course projects. You will solder circuit boards, measure waveforms with an oscilloscope, and build a power grid model using simulation software. After graduation, you can work in the power grid, new energy (wind power, photovoltaics, energy storage), electric vehicles, or hardware companies. You need a solid foundation in both physics and mathematics, and it's common to find yourself unable to finish writing your lab reports.","适合喜欢动手搭电路、不怕物理公式的人。怕焊板子、怕算三相电的话会很煎熬。":"Suitable for people who like to build circuits by hand and are not afraid of physics formulas. It can be quite agonizing if you're afraid of soldering circuit boards or calculating three-phase power.","电子科学与技术更钻「器件和芯片」这一层。学半导体物理、集成电路设计、光电子、传感器，搞清楚一颗芯片里的晶体管怎么工作、版图怎么画、电路怎么仿真。会有进洁净实验室做器件测试的机会，显微镜下看的是微米级的东西。它比电气更微观，比计算机更硬件，是芯片行业的对口专业。":"Electronic Science and Technology focuses more on the \"devices and chips\" level. Study semiconductor physics, integrated circuit design, optoelectronics, and sensors to understand how transistors in a chip work, how to draw layouts, and how to simulate circuits. There will be opportunities to enter clean labs to test devices, and what you see under the microscope are objects at the micrometer level. It is more microscopic than electrical engineering and more hardware-oriented than computer science. It is the corresponding major for the chip industry.","适合对「东西为什么能导电、能发光」有兴趣、能忍受抽象物理的人。想一上来就写代码的会失望。":"Suitable for those who are interested in \"why things can conduct electricity and emit light\" and can tolerate abstract physics. Those who want to start writing code right away will be disappointed.","数字媒体技术是计算机和设计之间的桥。你既写代码也做画面：学编程基础、图形学、图像处理、游戏引擎、交互设计，做小游戏、做可视化、做 VR 场景。作业常常是「做出一个能玩/能看的东西」，所以既要会调 bug，也要有审美。比纯计算机轻松一点，但技术要求没降。":"Digital media technology is the bridge between computers and design. You both write code and create visuals: You learn the fundamentals of programming, computer graphics, image processing, game engines, and interaction design, and you create small games, visualizations, and VR scenes. Assignments often involve \"creating something that can be played/watched,\" so you need to know how to fix bugs and also have a sense of aesthetics. It's a little easier than pure computer science, but the technical requirements haven't been lowered.","适合既想写代码又想搞创作的人。只想做纯美术或只想做纯后台的，读起来都会有点别扭。":"Suitable for people who want to both write code and engage in creative work. Those who only want to do pure art or only want to do pure back-end work will find it a bit awkward to read.","信息与计算科学本质是「数学系里偏计算的 branch」：数学分析、高等代数、概率统计打底，再加数值计算、优化方法、算法与数据结构、编程。你学的不是怎么装电脑，而是怎么用数学把问题变成能算的形式，比如预测、拟合、压缩、加密。数学课比重比计算机专业还大。":"Information and Computational Science is essentially \"a branch of mathematics that leans towards computation\": it is founded on mathematical analysis, advanced algebra, and probability and statistics, with the addition of numerical computation, optimization methods, algorithms and data structures, and programming. You don't learn how to assemble a computer, but rather how to use mathematics to transform problems into calculable forms, such as prediction, fitting, compression, and encryption. Mathematics courses make up a larger proportion of the curriculum than computer science courses.","适合数学底子好、喜欢证明和推导、又不想只做纯理论的人。怕数学分析的话慎入。":"Suitable for people with a strong mathematical background who enjoy proofs and derivations but don't want to focus solely on pure theory. If you're afraid of mathematical analysis, think twice before taking this course.","机械电子工程 = 机械 + 电子 + 控制。它研究怎么让机器自己动起来：学机械设计、传感器、电机驱动、嵌入式控制、机器人学，最后把机械结构、电路和程序拼成一个能动的系统。实验课上你会装小车、调电机、写控制代码，东西不动就得从头查是机械卡了还是电接错了。":"Mechanical and Electrical Engineering = Mechanics + Electronics + Control. It studies how to make machines move on their own: learning mechanical design, sensors, motor drives, embedded control, and robotics, and finally assembling mechanical structures, circuits, and programs into a functioning system. In the lab, you'll assemble a small vehicle, adjust the motor, and write control code. If something doesn't move, you'll have to start from the beginning to check whether it's a mechanical jam or an electrical connection error.","适合喜欢拆东西、装东西、动手又动脑的人。只想坐办公室写代码的会觉得车间太多。":"Suitable for people who like to take things apart, assemble things, and use both their hands and their brains. Those who only want to sit in an office and write code will find there are too many workshops.","通信工程研究信息怎么从 A 点可靠地传到 B 点。课程有信号与系统、通信原理、数字信号处理、电磁场与天线、无线网络。你会算带宽、算误码率、用软件仿真调制解调，也会碰 5G、光纤、卫星这些真实系统。数学（尤其是复变和概率）用得很多。":"Communications engineering studies how information can be reliably transmitted from point A to point B. Courses include Signals and Systems, Principles of Communication, Digital Signal Processing, Electromagnetic Fields and Antennas, and Wireless Networks. You will calculate bandwidth and bit error rate, simulate modulation and demodulation using software, and also encounter real-world systems such as 5G, fiber optics, and satellites. Mathematics (especially complex analysis and probability) is used extensively.","适合喜欢信号、波形、数学推导的人。对「看不见摸不着」的抽象系统没耐心的话会比较吃力。":"Suitable for people who like signals, waveforms, and mathematical derivations. It can be quite challenging if you don't have patience for abstract systems that are \"invisible and intangible.\"","建筑学是五年制，学的是怎么设计一栋能站住、好用、还好看房子。核心是设计课（studio）：每学期一个题目，从调研、画草图、做模型到出图，老师每周评图、让你改。配套课有建筑史、结构、材料与构造、制图与建模软件。工作量很大，通宵赶图是这行的传统，但也有很强的成就感。":"Architecture is a five-year program that teaches you how to design a house that is structurally sound, functional, and aesthetically pleasing. The core is the design course (studio): one topic per semester, from research, sketching, and model-making to drawing production. The teacher reviews the drawings every week and asks you to make revisions. Complementary courses include architectural history, structures, materials and construction, and drafting and modeling software. The workload is heavy, and staying up all night to finish drawings is a tradition in this field, but it also brings a strong sense of accomplishment.","适合既喜欢画东西又愿意琢磨结构和人的使用方式的人。怕熬夜、怕被反复否定方案的话要谨慎。":"Suitable for people who enjoy drawing and are willing to think about structure and how people use things. Be cautious if you are afraid of staying up late or having your designs repeatedly rejected.","工业设计做的是「批量生产的东西长什么样、好不好用」：手机、椅子、家电、医疗器械。学设计手绘、三维建模、人机工程、材料与工艺、用户研究，作业通常是完整做一款产品——调研、草图、建模、做原型、答辩。既要审美，也要懂制造能不能做出来。":"Industrial design is concerned with \"what mass-produced items look like and whether they are easy to use\": cell phones, chairs, household appliances, and medical devices. You learn design sketching, 3D modeling, ergonomics, materials and processes, and user research. Assignments typically involve creating a complete product – research, sketching, modeling, prototyping, and presentation. You need to have an eye for aesthetics, but also understand whether it can be manufactured.","适合爱观察生活里的小毛病、喜欢动手做原型的人。只想画画不想考虑成本和工艺的会碰壁。":"Suitable for people who like to observe the little flaws in life and enjoy making prototypes by hand. Those who only want to draw and don't want to consider costs and manufacturing processes will hit a dead end.","土木工程管的是桥、路、楼、隧道、大坝怎么建、怎么不塌。学结构力学、材料力学、混凝土与钢结构、土力学、施工管理，用软件算受力、画施工图。实验课上会把混凝土试块压碎看强度。行业成熟、就业稳定，但工作环境常在工地或设计院。":"Civil engineering deals with how to build bridges, roads, buildings, tunnels, and dams, and how to prevent them from collapsing. You will study structural mechanics, materials mechanics, concrete and steel structures, soil mechanics, and construction management. You will use software to calculate stresses and draw construction drawings. In the lab, concrete test blocks are crushed to test their strength. The industry is mature and employment is stable, but the work environment is often on construction sites or in design institutes.","适合踏实、对力学有兴趣、不排斥去现场的人。想要高薪快节奏的可能会觉得传统。":"Suitable for people who are down-to-earth, interested in mechanics, and don't mind going to the site. Those who want a high salary and a fast-paced environment may find it traditional.","城乡规划站在比建筑更大的尺度上：一个街区、一座城怎么布局，学校、医院、地铁、绿地放在哪。学城市规划原理、GIS 空间分析、交通规划、城市经济与政策，作业多为实地调研 + 画图 + 写报告。它一半是设计，一半是社会科学，要和政府、居民、开发商打交道。":"Urban and rural planning operates on a larger scale than architecture: how to lay out a neighborhood or a city, and where to place schools, hospitals, subways, and green spaces. You study urban planning principles, GIS spatial analysis, transportation planning, urban economics and policy. Most assignments involve field research + drawing + report writing. It's half design and half social science, and involves interacting with the government, residents, and developers.","适合关心城市问题、喜欢跑现场做调研、愿意写长报告的人。纯宅在电脑前的人会不适应。":"Suitable for people who are concerned about urban issues, enjoy conducting on-site research, and are willing to write long reports. People who are purely homebodies in front of their computers will not be suited to this role.","传播学教你理解信息是怎么被生产、传播和接受的。课程有传播理论、新闻写作、影视制作、广告与公关、社交媒体分析。作业常常是拍片、写稿、做 campaign、分析热搜为什么火。它不训练你当网红，而是训练你看懂媒体背后的机制，并能自己做出内容。":"Communication Studies teaches you to understand how information is produced, disseminated, and received. Courses include communication theory, journalism, film and video production, advertising and public relations, and social media analysis. Assignments often involve filming, writing, creating campaigns, and analyzing why trending topics are popular. It doesn't train you to become an influencer, but rather to understand the mechanisms behind the media and to be able to create content yourself.","适合爱表达、爱观察社会、愿意动手拍和写的人。期待「轻松不考试」的会失望，论文和作品都不少。":"Suitable for people who love to express themselves, observe society, and are willing to take photos and write. Those who expect a \"relaxed, exam-free\" experience will be disappointed, as there are quite a few papers and assignments.","英语（金融商务英语）是英语+商科的组合。你要把英语练到能读财报、写商务邮件、做英文汇报的水平，同时学经济学原理、会计基础、市场营销、跨文化商务沟通。毕业后常见去向是外企、咨询、金融后台，或者继续读商科硕士。":"English (Financial Business English) is a combination of English and Business. You need to develop your English skills to a level where you can read financial reports, write business emails, and deliver presentations in English, while also studying principles of economics, fundamentals of accounting, marketing, and cross-cultural business communication. After graduation, common career paths include foreign companies, consulting firms, financial back-office roles, or pursuing a master's degree in business.","适合英语底子好、又想沾点商科的人。既不想深耕文学也不想啃硬数学的，这条路比较平衡。":"Suitable for those with a strong foundation in English who also want to explore business studies. This path is more balanced for those who don't want to delve deeply into literature or grapple with challenging mathematics.","翻译专业练的是中英之间准确、得体地转换。课程有笔译、口译（交传、同传入门）、翻译理论、术语与 CAT 工具、跨文化交际。课上会反复练：一段新闻、一份合同、一场会议，怎么翻才不失真也不生硬。高强度双语训练，词汇量和反应速度是硬指标。":"The Translation program focuses on accurate and appropriate translation between Chinese and English. The program includes courses in translation, interpreting (consecutive and simultaneous interpreting – introductory level), translation theory, terminology and CAT tools, and intercultural communication. In class, we repeatedly practice how to translate a news article, a contract, or a meeting without distorting the meaning or sounding unnatural. In high-intensity bilingual training, vocabulary and response speed are key metrics.","适合中英文都好、对语言细节敏感、抗压能力强的人。口译课的心理压力比想象中大。":"Suitable for individuals who are proficient in both Chinese and English, sensitive to linguistic details, and have a strong ability to handle pressure. The psychological pressure in interpreting classes is greater than one might imagine.","国际事务与国际关系研究国家之间怎么打交道：为什么结盟、为什么制裁、国际组织怎么运作。课程有国际关系理论、外交史、国际政治经济、区域研究（东亚、中东、欧洲），大量阅读英文文献和写分析文章。它偏文科思维，重论证而非计算。":"International Affairs and International Relations studies how countries interact with each other: why they form alliances, why they impose sanctions, and how international organizations operate. Courses include International Relations Theory, Diplomatic History, International Political Economy, and Regional Studies (East Asia, the Middle East, Europe). There is a significant amount of reading of English-language literature and writing of analytical essays. It leans towards liberal arts thinking, emphasizing argumentation over calculation.","适合关心时事、爱读新闻和历史的、英文阅读量大的人。想要技能型硬本领的会觉得偏虚。":"Suitable for people who are interested in current affairs, enjoy reading news and history, and read a lot in English. Those who want to acquire hard skills may find it too abstract.","英语（应用语言学）研究语言本身怎么运作、怎么教、怎么学。课程有语言学导论、音系与句法、二语习得、语言测试、语料库分析。你会分析真实的语料，研究人为什么这么说话、学外语卡在哪。毕业方向包括英语教学、教材出版、语言科技。":"English (Applied Linguistics) studies how language itself works, how it is taught, and how it is learned. Courses include Introduction to Linguistics, Phonology and Syntax, Second Language Acquisition, Language Testing, and Corpus Analysis. You will analyze real-world language data, studying why people speak the way they do and identifying the challenges people face when learning a foreign language. Career paths after graduation include English language teaching, textbook publishing, and language technology.","适合对语言规律好奇、愿意做细致分析的人。只想提高口语的，这个专业给不了速成。":"Suitable for those who are curious about linguistic patterns and willing to engage in detailed analysis. If you only want to improve your speaking skills, this program won't provide a quick fix.","英语（传媒英语）把语言能力和传媒素养绑在一起。你学英语写作与编辑、媒体与社会、新闻采编、视觉传达，练的是用英文做出能发布的内容——报道、脚本、专题、社交媒体文案。比纯传播学更强调语言功底，比纯英语更强调产出。":"English (Media English) combines language skills with media literacy. You will study English writing and editing, media and society, news reporting and editing, and visual communication. You will practice creating publishable content in English — reports, scripts, features, and social media copy. It places more emphasis on language skills than pure communication studies and more emphasis on output than pure English.","适合英文写作强、想做内容的人。不爱改稿、受不了反复打磨文字的话会很累。":"Suitable for people who are strong in English writing and want to create content. It can be exhausting if you don't like editing and can't stand repeatedly refining the text.","英语（全球语境下的英语研究）偏文学与文化研究：后殖民文学、世界英语、文化理论、影视与文本分析。读的是各国用英语写的小说、电影、论述，讨论身份、权力、翻译与全球化。写作量大，靠阅读量和观点取胜。":"English (English Studies in a Global Context) with a focus on literary and cultural studies: postcolonial literature, World Englishes, cultural theory, film and television, and textual analysis. The course involves reading novels, films, and essays written in English from various countries, and discussing identity, power, translation, and globalization. There is a large amount of writing, and success depends on the volume of reading and the strength of one's perspectives.","适合爱读文学作品、愿意深挖文本和文化议题的人。期待实用技能训练的会不适应。":"Suitable for those who enjoy reading literary works and are willing to delve deeply into texts and cultural topics. Those who expect practical skills training will not find it suitable.","汉学与中国学研究中国，但用的是国际学术的视角和方法。课程有中国历史、哲学、社会、经济、中外文化交流，读中英文双语的文献，讨论「中国」这个概念是怎么被理解和叙述的。适合未来做文化传播、国际教育、公共事务。":"Sinology and China Studies research China, but from an international academic perspective and using international academic methods. The courses cover Chinese history, philosophy, society, economy, and cultural exchanges between China and other countries. Students read literature in both Chinese and English and discuss how the concept of \"China\" is understood and narrated. Suitable for future careers in cultural communication, international education, and public affairs.","适合对中外文化差异敏感、愿意大量阅读和写作的人。想学「实用技术」的会觉得偏学术。":"Suitable for people who are sensitive to cultural differences between China and other countries and are willing to read and write extensively. Those who want to learn \"practical skills\" will find it too academic.","经济学研究人和社会怎么分配稀缺资源：价格为什么涨、政策有没有用、市场为什么会失灵。核心是微观、宏观、计量（用数据检验理论），数学要求不低，要会建模和跑回归。它不给标准答案，而是训练你用模型和数据讲清一个机制。":"Economics studies how people and society allocate scarce resources: why prices rise, whether policies are effective, and why markets fail. The core of economics is microeconomics, macroeconomics, and econometrics (using data to test theories). The mathematical requirements are not low, and you need to be able to build models and run regressions. It doesn't provide standard answers, but instead trains you to explain a mechanism using models and data.","适合喜欢逻辑推理、不怕数学、爱追问「为什么」的人。想学炒股技巧的会失望，这不是投资课。":"Suitable for people who enjoy logical reasoning, are not afraid of math, and love to ask \"why.\" Those who want to learn stock trading techniques will be disappointed. This is not an investment course.","经济与金融把经济学的地基和金融的操作结合起来：公司金融、投资学、金融市场、衍生品、计量经济。你会学怎么给资产定价、怎么评估一个项目值不值得投、怎么用数据验证策略。比纯经济学更贴近行业，比纯会计更偏分析和建模。":"Economics and Finance combine the foundations of economics with financial operations: corporate finance, investment, financial markets, derivatives, and econometrics. You will learn how to price assets, how to evaluate whether a project is worth investing in, and how to use data to validate strategies. It is closer to the industry than pure economics, and more focused on analysis and modeling than pure accounting.","适合数学不错、对市场有兴趣、能承受高强度竞争的人。投行券商方向的实习竞争非常激烈。":"Suitable for people who are good at math, interested in the market, and can withstand intense competition. Competition for internships in investment banking and brokerage is very fierce.","会计学是商业世界的记账语言：企业赚了多少、欠了多少、钱花在哪，都要靠会计说清楚。课程有财务会计、管理会计、审计、税法、公司报告，很多内容对接 ACCA 等证书考试。它规则性强、细节多，一分钱对不上就得查到底。":"Accounting is the language of bookkeeping in the business world: how much a company earns, how much it owes, and where its money is spent all need to be clarified through accounting. Courses include Financial Accounting, Management Accounting, Auditing, Tax Law, and Corporate Reporting, with much of the content aligned with certification exams such as ACCA. It is highly rule-based and detail-oriented. If even a single cent doesn't add up, you have to investigate until you find the cause.","适合细心、有耐心、对规则和数字敏感的人。讨厌重复核对的人做这行会很痛苦。":"Suitable for people who are meticulous, patient, and sensitive to rules and numbers. People who dislike repetitive checking will find this job very stressful.","信息管理与信息系统在业务和技术之间搭桥：企业要不要上这套系统、数据怎么存、流程怎么优化。学数据库、系统分析与设计、项目管理、数据分析、企业资源计划（ERP）。你会写一些代码，但更主要是把业务需求翻译成技术方案。":"Information management and information systems bridge the gap between business and technology: whether a company should adopt this system, how to store data, and how to optimize processes. Study databases, systems analysis and design, project management, data analysis, and enterprise resource planning (ERP). You will write some code, but more importantly, you will translate business requirements into technical solutions.","适合沟通能力强、既不怕技术也不怕开会的人。想纯写代码或纯做管理的都不太对口。":"Suitable for individuals with strong communication skills who are not afraid of technology or meetings. Those who want to focus solely on coding or management are not a good fit.","国际商务研究企业怎么跨国做生意：进入哪个市场、怎么定价、供应链怎么排、文化差异怎么处理。课程有国际营销、跨文化管理、全球供应链、国际商法。这个专业要求修满两阶段第二外语，说明它真的把「跨语言」当成本钱。":"International Business Studies examines how companies conduct business across borders: which markets to enter, how to set prices, how to organize supply chains, and how to handle cultural differences. Courses include International Marketing, Cross-Cultural Management, Global Supply Chain, and International Business Law. This program requires the completion of two levels of a second foreign language, which shows that it truly considers \"cross-linguistic\" skills as a fundamental asset.","适合对外面的世界好奇、愿意学第二外语、擅长团队合作的人。不喜欢小组作业的会很难受。":"Suitable for people who are curious about the outside world, willing to learn a second foreign language, and good at teamwork. It will be difficult for those who don't like group work.","工商管理覆盖面最广：战略、组织行为、运营、市场、财务、创业都要懂一点。它不教你某一项硬技术，而是训练你怎么看一家公司的整体、怎么带团队、怎么在信息不全时做决定。案例讨论和小组汇报占了很大比重。":"Business administration has the broadest scope: you need to have some knowledge of strategy, organizational behavior, operations, marketing, finance, and entrepreneurship. It doesn't teach you a specific hard skill, but rather trains you in how to view a company as a whole, how to lead a team, and how to make decisions when information is incomplete. Case discussions and group presentations make up a significant portion of the program.","适合表达能力强、喜欢和人打交道、能自己驱动学习的人。指望课堂直接给硬技能的会失落。":"Suitable for people with strong communication skills, who enjoy interacting with others, and who are self-motivated to learn. Those who expect the class to directly provide hard skills will be disappointed.","市场营销研究怎么让人想买、愿意买、买了还回来。课程有消费者行为、品牌管理、市场调研、数字营销、定价策略。你会做问卷、跑数据、写方案、做提案，分析一个campaign 为什么有效。它比想象中理性，靠数据说话的部分很多。":"Marketing research explores how to make people want to buy, be willing to buy, and come back after buying. The courses include Consumer Behavior, Brand Management, Market Research, Digital Marketing, and Pricing Strategies. You'll create questionnaires, crunch data, write plans, make proposals, and analyze why a campaign is effective. It's more logical than you might think, and a lot of it is based on data.","适合对人心和商业都好奇、愿意做调研和表达的人。只想做创意不想看数据的话会吃力。":"Suitable for people who are curious about human nature and business, and who are willing to conduct research and express their ideas. It will be difficult if you only want to be creative and don't want to look at data.","人力资源管理（人才分析）研究怎么招人、用人、留人，而且越来越靠数据。课程有组织行为学、招聘与选拔、薪酬设计、绩效管理、人力数据分析。你会算人员流失率、做岗位画像、设计考核方案，不是只发发offer。":"Human Resource Management (Talent Analytics) studies how to recruit, employ, and retain talent, and increasingly relies on data. Courses include Organizational Behavior, Recruitment and Selection, Compensation Design, Performance Management, and Workforce Data Analytics. You'll calculate employee turnover rates, create job profiles, and design performance evaluation plans – it's not just about sending out job offers.","适合善于沟通、又愿意用数据说话的人。以为 HR 就是「聊聊天」的会改观。":"Suitable for people who are good at communication and willing to let data speak for itself. Those who think that HR is just about \"chatting\" will change their minds.","金融数学用数学工具给金融产品定价、衡量风险。核心课是概率论、随机过程、数值方法、金融衍生品、风险模型，工具是随机微积分和编程（Python/C++）。它是数学系里最贴近市场的一个，也是全校最热门的专业之一，课业强度大。":"Financial mathematics uses mathematical tools to price financial products and measure risk. The core courses are Probability Theory, Stochastic Processes, Numerical Methods, Financial Derivatives, and Risk Models, with stochastic calculus and programming (Python/C++) as the tools. It is the most market-oriented major in the Department of Mathematics and one of the most popular majors in the entire university. The academic workload is heavy.","适合数学非常扎实、能扛住高强度推导、对量化交易有兴趣的人。数学怕苦的绝对不要选。":"Suitable for individuals with a very strong foundation in mathematics, who can handle rigorous derivations, and have an interest in quantitative trading. Those who are afraid of the hard work involved in mathematics should definitely not choose this program.","精算学算的是「未来可能发生的坏事要花多少钱」：保险定价、养老金、 catastrophe 风险。课程有精算数学、风险理论、生存模型、统计与金融，内容对接英国精算师协会的考试科目。学出来可以去保险公司、咨询公司、精算部门。":"Actuarial science calculates \"how much it will cost for bad things that may happen in the future\": insurance pricing, pensions, and catastrophe risk. The courses include actuarial mathematics, risk theory, survival models, statistics, and finance, and the content is aligned with the examination subjects of the Institute and Faculty of Actuaries in the UK. After graduation, you can work at insurance companies, consulting firms, or actuarial departments.","适合数学好、细心、愿意长期考证的人。精算证是长跑，急着变现的会失望。":"Suitable for people who are good at math, meticulous, and willing to study for certification over the long term. Obtaining an actuarial certification is a long-distance race. Those who are eager for quick returns will be disappointed.","应用数学把抽象的数学用到真实问题上：物理、工程、生物、金融里都能建模。学数学分析、常微分与偏微分方程、数值计算、优化、建模。它比纯数学更接地气，比工程数学更深，重点是「把现实翻译成方程，再解出来」。":"Applied mathematics applies abstract mathematics to real-world problems: models can be created in physics, engineering, biology, and finance. Study mathematical analysis, ordinary and partial differential equations, numerical computation, optimization, and modeling. It is more down-to-earth than pure mathematics and more in-depth than engineering mathematics. The focus is on \"translating reality into equations and then solving them.\"","适合喜欢推导、享受把复杂问题化简的人。讨厌证明题的话会很痛苦。":"Suitable for those who like to deduce and enjoy simplifying complex problems. It would be very agonizing if you hate proof problems.","应用物理学研究物质世界的基本规律，并把这些规律用到技术上：半导体、光学、材料、量子信息。学力学、电磁学、热统、量子力学、固体物理，配大量实验课。它比工程更追问原理，比纯物理更强调应用出口。":"Applied physics studies the fundamental laws of the material world and applies these laws to technology: semiconductors, optics, materials, and quantum information. Study mechanics, electromagnetism, statistical mechanics, quantum mechanics, and solid-state physics, with a large number of laboratory classes. It focuses more on principles than engineering and emphasizes practical applications more than pure physics.","适合对「世界为什么这样运转」有执念、数学物理都强的人。想要快速就业技能的会觉得偏基础。":"Suitable for people who are obsessed with \"why the world works this way\" and are strong in both mathematics and physics. Those who want to quickly acquire job skills will find it too basic.","生物信息学用计算机和统计去解生物数据：基因测序、蛋白质结构、疾病关联。你既要学分子生物学、遗传学，也要学编程、算法、统计和机器学习，最后用代码从几百万条序列里找规律。是生物和计算机的交叉，两个都要学。":"Bioinformatics uses computers and statistics to analyze biological data: gene sequencing, protein structure, and disease associations. You need to study molecular biology and genetics, as well as programming, algorithms, statistics, and machine learning. Ultimately, you'll use code to identify patterns from millions of sequences. It's an intersection of biology and computer science, and you have to study both.","适合对生命科学好奇、又不排斥写代码的人。只想做湿实验或只想写代码的都不太合适。":"Suitable for those who are curious about life sciences and don't mind writing code. It's not a good fit for those who only want to do wet lab work or only want to write code.","生物医学科学研究疾病在细胞和分子层面怎么发生：癌症、免疫、神经、感染。课程有细胞生物学、生物化学、生理学、病理学、免疫学，实验课占很大比重，要养细胞、跑电泳、做显微观察。它是医学研究的预备专业，不是临床医学，不能当医生。":"Biomedical sciences study how diseases occur at the cellular and molecular levels: cancer, immunology, neurology, and infectious diseases. The curriculum includes cell biology, biochemistry, physiology, pathology, and immunology. Laboratory classes make up a significant portion of the program, involving cell culture, electrophoresis, and microscopic observation. It is a preparatory program for medical research, not clinical medicine, and does not qualify one to become a doctor.","适合对疾病机制好奇、能耐心做重复实验的人。怕血腥或怕失败实验的要有心理准备。":"Suitable for those who are curious about disease mechanisms and can patiently conduct repetitive experiments. Those who are squeamish or afraid of failed experiments should be mentally prepared.","生物科学是更宽的生物学训练：从分子、细胞到生态、进化都要学。课程有细胞生物学、遗传学、生态学、进化论、生物统计，野外实习和实验室都会去。它给你一个完整的生命科学视角，方向可以往科研、环保、生物技术走。":"Biological sciences provide a broader education in biology, covering everything from molecules and cells to ecology and evolution. The curriculum includes cell biology, genetics, ecology, evolution, and biostatistics. Students will also participate in field studies and laboratory work. It gives you a comprehensive perspective on life sciences, and you can pursue careers in scientific research, environmental protection, or biotechnology.","适合真的喜欢自然和生命现象、愿意读大量英文文献的人。只想混个文凭的话这行不好混。":"It's suitable for people who truly love nature and life phenomena and are willing to read a large number of English-language publications. If you just want to get a degree, this field is not easy to navigate.","环境科学研究人和自然之间的相互影响：污染怎么产生、怎么治理、气候怎么变、生态怎么修复。课程有环境化学、环境监测、生态学、环境政策与环评，会做水样土样分析、跑模型预测。偏理科，也沾政策和管理的边。":"Environmental science studies the interactions between humans and nature: how pollution is generated and controlled, how the climate changes, and how ecosystems are restored. The curriculum includes Environmental Chemistry, Environmental Monitoring, Ecology, Environmental Policy, and Environmental Impact Assessment. Students will learn to analyze water and soil samples and run predictive models. It leans towards science, but also touches on policy and management.","适合关心环境议题、愿意做实验和野外调查的人。期待高薪快回报的要有心理准备。":"Suitable for people who care about environmental issues and are willing to conduct experiments and field surveys. Those who expect high salaries and quick returns should be mentally prepared.","应用化学把化学原理用到产品和工艺上：新材料、药物、电池、化妆品、食品。学无机、有机、分析、物理化学四大基础，加上大量实验课——合成、提纯、表征。你会反复做实验、记录数据、分析图谱，手上功夫和耐心都很重要。":"Applied chemistry applies chemical principles to products and processes: new materials, pharmaceuticals, batteries, cosmetics, and food. You will study the four fundamental branches of chemistry: inorganic, organic, analytical, and physical chemistry, along with numerous laboratory sessions focused on synthesis, purification, and characterization. You will repeatedly conduct experiments, record data, and analyze diagrams. Practical skills and patience are both very important.","适合喜欢动手做实验、对物质变化好奇的人。怕化学品、怕长时间站实验室的慎入。":"Suitable for people who like to do hands-on experiments and are curious about changes in matter. Those who are afraid of chemicals or of standing in the lab for long periods of time should think twice before entering.","材料科学与工程研究「东西是用什么做的、为什么这么结实/轻/耐热」。课程有材料科学基础、金属与陶瓷、高分子、复合材料、材料表征。你会在电镜下看晶粒、拉伸试样测强度，目标是设计出性能更好的新材料，比如电池材料、航空合金。":"Materials Science and Engineering studies \"What things are made of and why they are so strong/light/heat-resistant.\" Courses include Fundamentals of Materials Science, Metals and Ceramics, Polymers, Composites, and Material Characterization. You will observe grains under an electron microscope and measure the strength of tensile specimens. The goal is to design new materials with better performance, such as battery materials and aerospace alloys.","适合对微观结构好奇、愿意做实验和数据处理的人。想纯做设计或纯做软件的会不搭。":"Suitable for people who are curious about microstructures and willing to conduct experiments and process data. It wouldn't be a good fit for those who want to focus solely on design or software development.","药学管的是「药从哪来、怎么起作用、怎么安全地用」。课程有药物化学、药理学、药剂学、药物分析、临床药学基础，实验课要合成、配制剂、测含量。毕业后可去医院药房、药企研发或生产、药监部门。注意：这是药学，不是临床医学。":"Pharmacy deals with \"where drugs come from, how they work, and how to use them safely\". Courses include pharmaceutical chemistry, pharmacology, pharmaceutics, pharmaceutical analysis, and fundamentals of clinical pharmacy. Laboratory classes involve synthesis, formulation, and content measurement. After graduation, you can work in hospital pharmacies, in research and development or production departments of pharmaceutical companies, or in drug regulatory agencies. Note: This is pharmacy, not clinical medicine.","适合细心、对化学和人体机制都感兴趣的人。怕背大量药名和机制的话会很累。":"Suitable for meticulous individuals who are interested in chemistry and human body mechanisms. It can be exhausting if you're afraid of memorizing a large number of drug names and mechanisms.","生物制药聚焦「用生物体造药」：抗体、疫苗、基因治疗。课程有生物化学、分子生物学、发酵工程、生物分离工程、药物质量控制，实验里会养细胞、跑纯化柱、测蛋白活性。它比传统制药更前沿，也更依赖生物技术。":"Biopharmaceuticals focus on \"using living organisms to make drugs\": antibodies, vaccines, and gene therapy. The curriculum includes biochemistry, molecular biology, fermentation engineering, bioseparation engineering, and drug quality control. In the lab, students will culture cells, run purification columns, and measure protein activity. It is more cutting-edge than traditional pharmaceuticals and also more dependent on biotechnology.","适合对生物技术有兴趣、能接受实验周期长的人。急着看到成果的会有点难熬。":"Suitable for people who are interested in biotechnology and can accept long experimental cycles. It can be a bit tough for those who are eager to see results.","应用统计学（生物医学统计）是用数据回答医学问题：这个药有没有效、这个指标能不能预测疾病。学概率论、数理统计、回归分析、临床试验设计、统计编程（R/SAS）。你会和医生、生物学家合作，从数据里得出可靠结论。":"Applied statistics (biomedical statistics) uses data to answer medical questions: Is this drug effective? Can this indicator predict disease? Study probability theory, mathematical statistics, regression analysis, clinical trial design, and statistical programming (R/SAS). You will work with doctors and biologists to draw reliable conclusions from the data.","适合数学不错、做事严谨、喜欢和数据打交道的人。讨厌细节核对的话会出大错。":"Suitable for people who are good at math, meticulous, and enjoy working with data. If you hate checking details, you'll make big mistakes.","心理学研究人的行为和心理过程：为什么记不住、为什么会焦虑、群体怎么影响判断。课程有普通心理学、认知、发展、社会、变态心理学，还有统计与实验设计——心理学是理科，要做实验、跑数据。毕业方向有人力、用户研究、心理咨询（需继续深造）、教育。":"Psychology studies human behavior and mental processes: why we can't remember things, why we feel anxious, and how groups influence our judgment. Courses include General Psychology, Cognitive Psychology, Developmental Psychology, Social Psychology, Abnormal Psychology, as well as Statistics and Experimental Design – Psychology is a science, so it involves conducting experiments and analyzing data. Graduation pathways include human resources, user research, psychological counseling (requires further study), and education.","适合对人的行为好奇、能接受统计和实验方法的人。以为心理学就是「聊聊天开导人」的会失望。":"Suitable for those who are curious about human behavior and can accept statistical and experimental methods. Those who think that psychology is all about \"having a chat and giving people advice\" will be disappointed.","数字媒体艺术做的是「用技术做视觉作品」：动画、交互装置、影像、游戏美术、虚拟制片。课程有三维建模与动画、影像制作、交互设计、数字合成，作业都是产出作品——一段动画、一个装置、一支短片。技术是画笔，审美是核心。":"Digital media art is about \"creating visual works using technology\": animation, interactive installations, video, game art, and virtual production. The courses include 3D modeling and animation, video production, interaction design, and digital compositing. The assignments all involve creating works – an animation, an installation, or a short film. Technology is the paintbrush, and aesthetics is the core.","适合有审美、愿意学软件、能自己驱动创作的人。等着老师一步步教的会跟不上。":"Suitable for people with a sense of aesthetics, who are willing to learn software, and who can drive their own creative process. Those who wait for the teacher to guide them step by step will fall behind.","影视摄影与制作学的是怎么把一部片子拍出来：编剧、导演、摄影、灯光、录音、剪辑、制片。课上一边看片分析，一边真的扛机器出去拍，从短片作业到毕业作品。设备、场地、演员都要自己协调，团队协作和抗压能力比技术更重要。":"Film and video cinematography and production teaches you how to make a film: screenwriting, directing, cinematography, lighting, sound recording, editing, and producing. In class, we watch and analyze films while actually taking the equipment out to shoot, from short film assignments to graduation projects. You have to coordinate the equipment, locations, and actors yourself. Teamwork and the ability to handle pressure are more important than technical skills.","适合真的爱电影、能吃苦、擅长和人合作的人。怕熬夜拍摄、怕组里吵架的要想清楚。":"Suitable for people who truly love movies, can endure hardship, and are good at working with others. If you're afraid of late-night shoots or arguments within the team, you should think carefully.","广播电视学面向电视与网络视频的内容生产：节目策划、演播室制作、纪录片、短视频运营、视听语言。你会进演播室导播、写脚本、做后期，也会分析平台算法和观众数据。比影视制作更偏「栏目和平台」，节奏更快、产出更频繁。":"Radio and Television Studies focuses on content production for television and online video: program planning, studio production, documentaries, short video operations, and audiovisual language. You will direct in the studio, write scripts, and do post-production. You will also analyze platform algorithms and audience data. More focused on \"programs and platforms\" than on film and television production, with a faster pace and more frequent output.","适合对内容行业有热情、能适应快节奏和频繁改稿的人。不喜欢追热点的话会累。":"Suitable for people who are passionate about the content industry and can adapt to a fast-paced environment with frequent revisions. It can be tiring if you don't like chasing trending topics.","人工智能专业教你怎么让机器从数据里学规律：机器学习、深度学习、计算机视觉、自然语言处理、强化学习，还有支撑它们的数学（线代、概率、优化）和工程能力（Python、框架、部署）。太仓校区强调产业落地，会做真实企业项目。这个方向现在热，但也很卷。注意人工智能在西浦有两处：苏州园区走先进技术学院的专业分流，按大一上微积分与线性代数的均分录取；太仓这边的 Advanced Industrial AI 方向不设分数门槛，满足先修课就能报。站里这一张写的是太仓方向，园区的方向单独有一张卡。作为参照：2025-26 学年，园区那个方向按微积分+线代均分录取，分数线是 79.5 分。":"The Artificial Intelligence program teaches you how to enable machines to learn patterns from data: machine learning, deep learning, computer vision, natural language processing, reinforcement learning, as well as the mathematical foundations (linear algebra, probability, optimization) and engineering skills (Python, frameworks, deployment) that support them. The Taicang campus emphasizes practical industry application and works on real-world business projects. This field is currently popular, but it's also highly competitive. Note that there are two AI programs at XJTLU: the Suzhou Campus offers a specialized track through the School of Advanced Technology, with admission based on the average score in Calculus and Linear Algebra from the first semester of freshman year. The Advanced Industrial AI program at the Taicang Campus has no score requirement; students can apply as long as they meet the prerequisite courses. This card on the stand covers the Taicang program, while the Suzhou campus program has its own separate card. For reference: For the 2025–26 academic year, admission to the program at the Suzhou campus was based on the average score in Calculus and Linear Algebra, with a cutoff of 79.5.","适合数学和编程都愿意下功夫、能持续自学的人。只想「用用AI工具」的话撑不下来。":"Suitable for people who are willing to put in effort in both mathematics and programming and are capable of continuous self-study. If you just want to \"use AI tools,\" you won't be able to keep up.","人工智能（智能系统方向）是园区这边的人工智能专业，课程围绕「让机器自己从数据里学规律」展开：机器学习、深度学习、计算机视觉、自然语言处理、强化学习，再配上线代、概率、优化这些数学底子。你会大量写 Python，跑模型、调参数、看论文复现，最后把一个想法做成能跑的系统。这个方向这两年分数涨得快，课业也不轻。":"Artificial Intelligence (Intelligent Systems) is the AI major offered at the campus. The curriculum revolves around \"enabling machines to learn patterns from data on their own\": machine learning, deep learning, computer vision, natural language processing, and reinforcement learning, complemented by mathematical foundations such as linear algebra, probability, and optimization. You will write a lot of Python code, run models, adjust parameters, read papers to replicate results, and ultimately turn an idea into a functional system. The scores for this specialization have risen rapidly over the past two years, and the coursework is not easy.","适合数学底子不错、愿意长期自学的人。只想「用用 AI 工具」的话，这里会让你很难受。":"Suitable for people with a good foundation in mathematics who are willing to engage in long-term self-study. If you just want to \"use AI tools,\" this place will make you feel uncomfortable.","数据科学与大数据技术研究怎么从海量数据里挖出有用的东西：统计建模、机器学习、数据库与分布式计算、数据可视化。你会写 SQL 和 Python，处理几百万行的表，做预测模型，最后把结论讲给不懂技术的人听。三分之一是数学统计，三分之一是编程，三分之一是业务理解。":"Data Science and Big Data Technology research focuses on how to extract useful information from vast amounts of data: statistical modeling, machine learning, databases and distributed computing, and data visualization. You will write in SQL and Python, handle tables with millions of rows, create predictive models, and finally present your findings to non-technical audiences. One-third is mathematical statistics, one-third is programming, and one-third is business acumen.","适合喜欢从数据里找答案、既能写代码又能讲清楚的人。讨厌清洗脏数据的会崩溃。":"Suitable for people who like to find answers from data and who can both write code and explain things clearly. Those who hate cleaning up dirty data will break down.","微电子科学与工程专攻芯片：从半导体物理、器件原理，到集成电路设计、版图、封装测试。你会学一颗芯片从设计到流片的全流程，用 EDA 软件画电路、做仿真。这是当前国家重点方向，太仓校区和产业结合紧密。":"Microelectronics Science and Engineering specializes in chips: from semiconductor physics and device principles to integrated circuit design, layout, and packaging and testing. You will learn the entire process of a chip, from design to wafer fabrication, and use EDA software to draw circuits and perform simulations. This is currently a national priority, and the Taicang campus is closely integrated with industry.","适合物理和电路都学得下去、能耐得住枯燥细节的人。想快速出成果的要有耐心。":"Suitable for people who can study both physics and circuits and can tolerate tedious details. Those who want to see quick results need to be patient.","机器人工程研究怎么让机器感知、决策、行动：机器人学、运动学与动力学、传感器、控制算法、嵌入式系统、机器视觉。你会组装机械臂或移动机器人，写代码让它避障、抓取、走路径。机械、电子、算法三样都要碰。":"Robotics engineering studies how to enable machines to perceive, make decisions, and take actions: robotics, kinematics and dynamics, sensors, control algorithms, embedded systems, and machine vision. You will assemble robotic arms or mobile robots and write code to enable them to avoid obstacles, grasp objects, and navigate paths. You will work with mechanics, electronics, and algorithms.","适合动手能力强、喜欢把软硬件拼起来的人。只愿意写代码不想碰硬件的会受限。":"Suitable for people with strong hands-on skills who like to put software and hardware together. Those who are only willing to write code and don't want to deal with hardware will be limited.","智能制造工程是「工厂的现代化」：自动化产线、工业机器人、数字孪生、生产系统优化。学机械制造基础、控制工程、工业工程、制造执行系统，目标是让生产线更聪明、更少人、更稳定。太仓校区有真实产线环境。":"Smart Manufacturing Engineering is \"the modernization of factories\": automated production lines, industrial robots, digital twins, and production system optimization. Students learn the fundamentals of mechanical manufacturing, control engineering, industrial engineering, and manufacturing execution systems, with the goal of making production lines smarter, less labor-intensive, and more stable. The Taicang campus features a real production line environment.","适合对制造业升级有兴趣、愿意下车间又懂软件的人。嫌工厂环境枯燥的慎选。":"Suitable for people who are interested in manufacturing upgrades, willing to work in the workshop, and knowledgeable about software. Think twice if you find the factory environment boring.","物联网工程把「东西」连上网：传感器采集数据、无线传输、云端处理、应用层展示。学嵌入式系统、传感器技术、无线通信、边缘计算、物联网平台开发。你会做一个小系统：温湿度传感器 → 单片机 → 云 → 手机 App。":"IoT Engineering connects \"things\" to the internet: sensors collect data, which is then transmitted wirelessly, processed in the cloud, and displayed at the application layer. Learn about embedded systems, sensor technology, wireless communication, edge computing, and IoT platform development. You will build a small system: Temperature and humidity sensor → Microcontroller → Cloud → Mobile app.","适合喜欢做完整小系统、软硬件都能上手的人。只想做纯前端或纯算法的会觉得杂。":"Suitable for people who like to work on complete small systems and are comfortable with both software and hardware. Those who only want to work on pure front-end or pure algorithms will find it confusing.","供应链管理研究东西怎么从原料变成产品再送到你手上：采购、生产计划、仓储、物流、需求预测。学运营管理、供应链建模、数据分析、ERP 系统。目标是让整条链更省钱、更快、更抗风险（比如疫情断供）。":"Supply chain management studies how things go from raw materials to finished products and then into your hands: procurement, production planning, warehousing, logistics, and demand forecasting. Study operations management, supply chain modeling, data analysis, and ERP systems. The goal is to make the entire chain more cost-effective, faster, and more resilient to risks (such as supply disruptions due to a pandemic).","适合喜欢系统性思考、擅长协调多方的人。讨厌和数字、流程打交道的话会很枯燥。":"Suitable for people who like to think systematically and are good at coordinating multiple parties. It would be boring if you dislike dealing with numbers and processes.","艺术与科技是艺术和技术的混血：交互装置、数字展演、沉浸式空间、生成艺术。你会学编程创意（Processing、TouchDesigner）、空间与声音设计、传感器互动，作品常出现在展览和舞台上。它不追求「好看」，更追求「有想法、能互动」。":"Art and Technology is a fusion of art and technology: interactive installations, digital performances, immersive spaces, and generative art. You will learn creative programming (Processing, TouchDesigner), spatial and sound design, and sensor interaction. Your works will often be featured in exhibitions and on stage. It doesn't aim to be \"visually appealing\"; rather, it strives to be \"thought-provoking and interactive.\"","适合有强烈表达欲、愿意学技术工具的艺术型学生。想要稳定职业路径的会迷茫。":"Suitable for artistic students with a strong desire for self-expression and a willingness to learn technical tools. Those who want a stable career path will feel lost.","程序设计（C / C++）":"Programming (C/C++)","数据结构与算法":"Data Structures and Algorithms","计算机组成与体系结构":"Computer Organization and Architecture","操作系统":"OPERATING SYSTEM","数据库系统":"Database System","电路分析":"Electric Circuit Analysis","模拟电子技术":"Analog Electronic Technology","数字电子技术":"Digital Electronic Technology","电机与拖动":"Electrical Motor and Drive","自动控制原理":"Principles of Automatic Control","半导体物理":"Semiconductor Physics","模拟集成电路设计":"Analog Integrated Circuit Design","数字集成电路设计":"Digital Integrated Circuit Design","光电子与传感器":"Optoelectronics and Sensors","版图与 EDA":"Layout and EDA","面向对象程序设计":"Object-Oriented Programming","交互设计基础":"Fundamentals of Interaction Design","计算机图形学":"Computer Graphics","游戏与交互开发":"Game and Interactive Development","多媒体系统":"Multimedia system","数学分析":"Mathematical Analysis","数值计算方法":"Numerical analysis","数据结构":"Data Structures","概率与统计":"Probability and Statistics","最优化方法":"Methods of Optimization","机械原理":"Mechanical Principles","电路与电子技术":"Circuits and Electronics","传感器与检测":"Sensors and Detection","控制工程":"Control engineering","嵌入式系统":"Embedded System","信号与系统":"Signal and System","通信原理":"Principles of Communication"};
